GlassButton.description:
Surface beneath the control. `onMedia` uses the full liquid-glass recipe;
`onGlass` uses a lighter tonal lens so an existing glass tint is not
compounded. Defaults to `onMedia`.

GlassPanel.description:
Optional structured action at the trailing edge of the header. On desktop,
prefer an intent-labeled `glassButton`, such as “Leave” on a shop screen;
a generic X `iconButton` is discouraged for panel navigation.

IconButton.description:
Surface beneath the control. `onMedia` uses the full liquid-glass recipe;
`onGlass` uses a lighter tonal lens so an existing glass tint is not
compounded. Defaults to `onMedia`.
